            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The invention concerns a method of accessing a target cell of an automated storage and retrieval system (1) by taking into account whether a further container handling vehicle (3) is within a predetermined distance (D) of a container handling vehicle (2) assigned with a task that includes accessing of said target cell. Furthermore, the invention relates to an automated storage and retrieval system (1) configured to execute said method.</p>
